Source-landscape note: The 2023 documentary universe is substantial but uneven. Core source families include Pakistan’s PNRA and Foreign Ministry records, IAEA safeguards and nuclear-security publications, SIPRI/FAS/Bulletin assessments, arms-control research, U.S. government studies, Pakistani policy institutes, treaty and regulatory materials, and contemporaneous reporting on Shehbaz Sharif’s India-related statements. Several records concern Pakistan’s broader nuclear posture rather than Sharif personally; they remain candidates for inherited baseline, institutional authority, implementation, and end-of-period posture. Access statuses reflect discovery-stage handling only.

